/Title (For instance, Flutter is an open-source toolkit developed by Google that can be used to create native apps for Android and iOS devices \(as well as applications for Windows, Mac, and the Web\). React Native is another open-source tool that uses React and JavaScript to build native iOS, Android, Windows, and Mac apps. Appery.io is a cloud-based platform that enables you to use a drag-and-drop visual builder tool to create HTML5 apps using jQuery Mobile. Appery.io supports Android and iOS applications.)
/Dest [58 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2026 0 R
/Prev 2033 0 R
